{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"3464e76f675be5d82cc9ffc8790b8537ea5d25b9f1da326c27c862c5ac7504e2","slug":"problemandbackground","location":"/chapter_mt/01_ProblemAndBackground.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"01_ProblemAndBackground.md","url":"/ai-mt-book/build/01_ProblemAndBackgro-4ce99c6a02833f40160dea36a808581c.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"---","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"uYWjrH160K"}],"key":"GebMjKwvXt"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"# 📘 2️⃣ 01_problem.md","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"cuwY2g1hTd"}],"key":"EGJS0qGQT3"},{"type":"code","lang":"markdown","value":"\n\\# 1 问题分析与研究背景\n\n\n\n机器翻译是人工智能的重要应用方向之一，其目标是实现不同语言之间的自动转换。\n\n\n\n在实际应用中，不同语言之间存在显著差异：\n\n\n\n\\## 1.1 汉英翻译\n\n\n\n\\- 语序相似\n\n\\- 数据资源丰富\n\n\\- 模型效果较好\n\n\n\n\\## 1.2 汉蒙翻译\n\n\n\n\\- 语序差异明显\n\n\\- 词形变化复杂\n\n\\- 数据资源稀缺\n\n\n\n\\## 1.3 跨书写体系问题\n\n\n\n蒙古语同时存在：\n\n\n\n\\- 传统蒙古文\n\n\\- 西里尔蒙古文\n\n\n\n👉 这引入新的问题：\n\n\n\n> 同一语言，不同符号系统如何转换？\n\n\n\n\\---\n\n\n\n\\## 1.4 本章研究目标\n\n\n\n本案例设计三层任务：\n\n\n\n1\\. 汉英翻译（基础）\n\n2\\. 汉蒙翻译（提升）\n\n3\\. 跨书写体系与系统串接（扩展）\n\n\n\n\\---\n\n\n\n\\## 1.5 技术流程\n\n\n\n```text\n\n数据准备 → 模型训练 → 翻译测试 → 对比分析 → 系统扩展\n","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":102,"column":1}},"key":"ac46L1OVCJ"}],"key":"l1UJd58Bb4"}],"key":"rHmjbkNKmt"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Index Table Of Contents And Introduction","url":"/index-tableofcontentsandintroduction","group":"人工智能交叉学科实践案例精析"},"next":{"title":"Data Construction","url":"/dataconstruction","group":"人工智能交叉学科实践案例精析"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}